DESCRIPTION:Get ready\, Indianapolis\, for a night of big laughs\, great f
 ood and unforgettable comedy!\nThe Comedy Café Comedy Series is bringing 
 acclaimed comedian and actor Gerald Kelly to the stage for one night only 
 on Saturday\, December 19\, 2026\, at 910 North Event Center.\nKnown as th
 e reigning "NY King of Comedy\," Gerald Kelly has entertained audiences ar
 ound the world with his signature style\, quick wit and larger-than-life p
 ersonality. With appearances on NBC's America's Got Talent\, Last Comic St
 anding\, HBO's Def Comedy Jam\, BET's Comic View\, Showtime at the Apollo
 \, Conan and Comedy Central\, he's no stranger to delivering laughs on som
 e of television's biggest stages.\nWhether you're a longtime fan or discov
 ering his comedy for the first time\, this is your chance to experience Ge
 rald Kelly live and up close.\nBring your friends\, make it a date night o
 r plan a much-needed night out. Enjoy great food from Kountry Kitchen and 
 an evening filled with the kind of laughter that makes the whole room feel
  good.\nDon't wait until everyone is talking about how much fun they had. 
 Get your tickets and join us at The Comedy Café!\nAbout Gerald Kelly\nGer
 ald Kelly is an internationally recognized stand-up comedian and actor who
  has built a multi-dimensional career performing for audiences around the 
 world. Known as the "NY King of Comedy\," he has earned praise from Russel
 l Simmons\, who calls him the "Black Jackie Gleason."\nHis television cred
 its include NBC's America's Got Talent (Season 16)\, Last Comic Standing (
 Season 😎\, HBO's Def Comedy Jam\, BET's Comic View\, Showtime at the Ap
 ollo\, Conan and Comedy Central. His film credits include Death of a Dynas
 ty\, The Cookout 2 and Budz House.\nThroughout his career\, Gerald has als
 o hosted and opened for comedy legends including Chris Rock\, Chris Tucker
 \, Steve Harvey and the late Bernie Mac.\nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, 
 December 19\, 2026\nLocation: 910 North Event Center/Kountry Kitchen\n1831
  N College Ave\nIndianapolis\, IN 46202\nDoors Open: 7:00 PM\nShow Starts:
  8:00 PM\nTickets: Starting at $28\nThere is a 2 item minimum in the show
 \nAge Requirement: 21+ to enter\nCome hungry\, bring your favorite people 
 and get ready to laugh. We'll see you at 910 North/Kountry Kitchen.
