DESCRIPTION:Murder at the Mic: A Comedy Murder Mystery Show\nStand-up come
 dy turns into a crime scene!\nGet ready\, Indianapolis! Murder at the Mic 
 is bringing a hilarious\, interactive comedy murder mystery experience to 
 the Wit Theater.\n\nWhat starts as a night of stand-up comedy takes a dead
 ly turn when someone is mysteriously murdered. Now the show must go on whi
 le everyone tries to figure out who did it!\n\nEnjoy a lineup of talented 
 comedians\, suspicious characters\, unexpected twists\, and plenty of laug
 hs as the mystery unfolds right before your eyes.\n\nBut here’s the twis
 t: YOU become part of the investigation! Pay close attention\, gather clue
 s\, question the suspects\, and see if you can solve the mystery before th
 e killer is revealed.\n\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\nLive stand-up comedy from ta
 lented comedians\nAn interactive murder mystery unfolding throughout the s
 how\nHilarious suspects\, hidden motives\, and unexpected twists\nAudience
  participation and opportunities to solve the crime\nPrizes for our sharpe
 st detectives\nA special holiday twist!\nWhether you’re planning a date 
 night\, a night out with friends\, or just looking for something different
 \, Murder at the Mic delivers a one-of-a-kind comedy experience.
GEO:39.7100774;-86.1398072
LOCATION:The Wit Theater - Home of ComedySportz\, 3808 Shelby Street\, Ind
 ianapolis\, 46227
URL:https://tickets.cszindianapolis.com/event/murder-at-the-mic-a-comedy-m
 urder-mystery-show-4lw6ww
