BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Swan Lake by International Ballet Stars in Fort Wayne\, IN
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270218T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270218T211000
UID:9bb10b37a04d52ed4af26f0079dc9c0d@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/3421395/event_image/Evvnt_cover_Swan_Lake.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Fort Wayne\, IN get ready - Swan Lake is coming to the Embassy
  Theatre for one unforgettable night!\n\nExperience the world's most belov
 ed ballet like never before. Following acclaimed\, sold-out runs across No
 rth America\, International Ballet Stars returns with a breathtaking produ
 ction set to Tchaikovsky's iconic score and performed by a world-class int
 ernational cast representing four continents.\nFrom the moonlit lakeside w
 here Princess Odette is held under a powerful spell\, to the dazzling roya
 l ballroom where the seductive Odile delivers the legendary 32 fouettés -
  every scene is filled with drama\, precision\, and unforgettable beauty.
 \n\nThis large-scale\, immersive\, Broadway-caliber production brings toge
 ther over 150 handcrafted costumes\, richly detailed sets\, and an excepti
 onal company of dancers to create a spectacular live experience. Elegant\,
  emotional\, and visually stunning\, Swan Lake is more than a ballet - it 
 is a night at the theater you will remember long after the final curtain.
 \n\nA timeless story of love\, betrayal\, and redemption\, captivating aud
 iences of all generations.\n\nThe performance is presented in two acts and
  runs 2 hours and 15 minutes\, including one 20-minute intermission.\nArti
 stic Direction: Artem Yachmennikov - Former Principal Dancer\, San Francis
 co Ballet & Dutch National Ballet.\n\nOne night only - secure your seats n
 ow!\n\nFor more info on the cast\, synopsis and FAQ\, visit: international
 balletstars.com\nTrailer: https://youtu.be/N-lvD5VmSeg\n\n🔔 Subscribe f
 or updates on upcoming performances across North America!\n🌐 Website: h
 ttps://internationalballetstars.com\n📘 Facebook: International Ballet S
 tars\n📸 Instagram: @internationalballetstars\n\nOn Sale from  Friday\, 
 August 7\, 2026! 
GEO:41.0757369;-85.1397624
LOCATION:Embassy Theatre\, 125 West Jefferson Boulevard\, Fort Wayne\, 468
 02
URL:https://internationalballetstars.com/events/fort-wayne-in
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
